---
import PolicyPage from "../components/PolicyPage.astro";
---

<PolicyPage
  title="Shipping Policy"
  description="Check Chocolate Circle delivery areas, delivery charges, and order timing before purchasing."
  kicker="A little note about delivery"
>
  <p>
    <strong>Effective date: 22 October 2026.</strong> Orders are prepared and delivered from
    M3, Pushpammal St, RG Nagar, Krishnaveni Nagar, Medavakkam, Vengavasal, Tamil Nadu 600073.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Delivery area and method</h2>
  <p>
    We deliver across India where a courier service can serve the destination. The delivery pin
    entered at checkout is used to estimate straight-line distance from the shop. At or within
    30 km, the order is suggested for Porter; beyond 30 km, it is suggested for courier. This is
    only an estimate and a recommendation for the shop. Road distance may differ, no provider is
    booked automatically, and delivery availability is confirmed with you after the order.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Delivery fee and confirmation</h2>
  <p>
    Checkout collects payment for the chocolate subtotal only; the delivery fee is not included.
    Immediately after you place an order, we will contact you to discuss the delivery option and
    quote its fee. The fee depends on the destination and available provider. You must accept
    and pay the quoted delivery fee separately before dispatch. If you decline the fee when it
    is first quoted, we will fully refund the product payment. We will not dispatch an order
    until the delivery arrangement and fee have been confirmed.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Preparation and delivery timing</h2>
  <p>
    Please allow at least 3 to 4 days for preparation. For an event order, delivery is planned
    for two days before the event or on the event date, depending on the location and the
    delivery arrangement confirmed with you. Tell us your event date when ordering and contact
    us before placing an order if you need it sooner. Preparation and transit estimates depend
    on the address and provider and are not guaranteed arrival times. We will discuss the
    expected delivery timing when confirming the delivery fee.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Chocolate care</h2>
  <p>
    Chocolates are packaged to withstand heat during ordinary transport, but keep them out of
    direct sunlight. Refrigerate them if you plan to consume them more than three days after
    delivery. Follow any additional storage instructions on the product packaging.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Delivery problems and returns</h2>
  <p>
    Please provide a complete, accurate delivery address and a reachable phone number. Contact
    us within one day of delivery if an order arrives damaged, incorrect, or incomplete. Damaged
    items are generally eligible for a full refund; the shop will assess the issue and confirm
    the appropriate full or partial refund. For an incorrect order, we will offer a refund or
    replacement. If the items need to be returned, the shop will cover the return courier charge.
    For other delivery problems, contact us promptly so we can review them with the provider.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you accept the quoted delivery fee and later request cancellation, the order is not
    refundable, except where a refund is required by applicable law or the shop cannot fulfil
    the accepted order. See our <a href="../terms-and-conditions/">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For delivery questions, contact
    <a href="mailto:alohomora.chocolatecircle@gmail.com">alohomora.chocolatecircle@gmail.com</a>
    or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/919500868468">+91 95008 68468</a>.
  </p>
</PolicyPage>
